WEBVTT

27:22.792 --> 27:23.792
I expected this.

27:24.750 --> 27:27.125
He has a fixated mindset.

27:27.584 --> 27:29.584
Once he sets his mind
to something, that's it.

27:29.959 --> 27:32.500
That is why we did what we had to.

27:33.417 --> 27:35.167
They say remove a thorn with a thorn.

27:36.084 --> 27:37.000
But what about Kallu?
